{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/6af4de815fead04ad4a5cac21f01216a.avif?t=1770455249\" width=616 height=138 /></span><br><br>Originally born during the GMTK 2023 Game Jam, 'Help Bipboop' is a challenging puzzler that will rev your cognitive gears. Guide Bipboop, the autonomously-driven little robot, to his destination. You do not control Bipboop directly. Instead, you arrange the terrain blocks to create his pathway. Once you have fine-tuned your path, hit the play button and Bipboop will perform his pre-programmed movement sequence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/aa1901bc934038d800d4726d53a8e2bc.avif?t=1770455249\" width=616 height=138 /></span><br><br>Bipboop's location resets if he falls off the grid or encounters any obstacles that might cause his demise. You must strategically place terrain blocks to keep him on the right path.<br>Here is an example of a movable terrain block:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/1139d442eff96dfa18fd9cf75349d7e8.avif?t=1770455249\" width=122 height=140 /></span><br><br>The game features various types of terrain blocks, including bridges, walls, buttons, and teleporters, allowing you to craft creative solutions to the puzzles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/e45fedf223f7cd86668453d112a00588.avif?t=1770455249\" width=158 height=108 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948300/extras/fef7ee18b769b98ad23a51be03aca918.avif?t=1770455249\" width=616 height=138 /></span><br><br>'Help Bipboop' also offers a level editor, allowing you to create your own custom levels and share them with your friends, adding a creative and social aspect to the game.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Don't look at your feet when you run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/a0dc10bfd2dc0652da8861bf3c51d4c1f1fda1ba.jpg"},{"name":"100% charged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/9266a1fe603ecb77884a02bb2b5a573f742ae0d4.jpg"},{"name":"glass breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/0f238b9aadbce581b7f25d72a25d482e92a5514a.jpg"},{"name":"Kids Garden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/0eabb224a6de2f6c204173e95d3a879efe9100aa.jpg"},{"name":"Weaving a link","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/1363d7eaccffd60520c21f8356fb87a440320334.jpg"},{"name":"Are we making skewers?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/6d20851110d889e1e96c73348b09f4bda3a6fa36.jpg"},{"name":"Outch my head","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/65e92fca3f7d4a4df43b6550adc89cdf0e99ee70.jpg"},{"name":"Assisted robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/0669649b8e87a7c11d14398610df1cdb80e173e5.jpg"},{"name":"The key to my heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/8dc8affa807a51af5ad018c3ad56755f5943ecc9.jpg"},{"name":"Thinking outside the box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1948300/b10e913237d35b6eb13d14c657256f9ad464c7a3.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1948300?t=1770455249","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1948300?t